{
  "module": "kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "06f5edc3a5f62311731b645c67f261c9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "7fb52d760c51ba0a652945639bfa98f325d0fe8a4f1f7ed308e43254c099859f",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "紛れもなく、%YOU%は前に出すぎた。鈴鹿の手を掴むつもりが、半歩多く出て、ちょうど鈴鹿の腰を抱き止めてしまった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d9631ca67d27ef24aaae689f40ba6acd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        23
      ],
      "originalHash": "589a662903a9b2fcc144b05ca6dc969288895afcb196c982e336eb6a7c95aa93",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "水筒とタオルを渡そうとして手を伸ばすと、鈴鹿はもう顔を覆って遠くへ走っていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "96ad4ed55a3693dcba84a4b9f8f36f9b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        30,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "10dff3408f640a6cd4c03dbed12deb69b28c918f2edcafb41bb5ff63c79c7d56",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "同じ寮の %S_NAME% は、頬を赤らめて笑いながら自分を抱きにくる %CHARA% を、ひどく不可解そうに見ていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c2980916549d9ec4ac9d0029adcd0cc9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        34,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "413450c58a6dff9f1187867a847d75aea70831d14a46e19e3d39ce216debc2ef",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% はぴたりと動きを止め、振り返って %S_NAME% を見た。相手は舌を出して、肩をすくめた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "855b8f5c0e395e4435cca1cb31fe4818",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        42,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "ca3cb5218d061039d529143e38e8864d83e0f2c5a7402897115c7e97ea8f8ec6",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "そのとき %CHARA% の頬も熱を帯びていたが、それでも %S_NAME% を見て、きっぱりと頷いた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "db3c588703eb323e17c67e861a0e2ab2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        45,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "15f31abd539e9cde7834b2110432a2d89729c7abbc0db32780f0866243f6d853",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "突然の仕草に %S_NAME% は飛び上がりそうになった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3558a74aa58777a2223b22b5981e7ce3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "44ab1c2b327021974acead4612e60a18efb7953192cab50cd2dae5dc5bd4744f",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "「%CALLNAME%……でしょうか。%YOURSEX%は私を細やかに気遣い、訓練計画を組んでくださって、これまでよりずっと美しい景色を見せてくれました……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7f59ba71ab6167296a3b1c75029e8456",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        5,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "ec825b23c9e83c55e72f99626e6635a94b30299535b8c4e843e44ee981b93cda",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "「%YOURSEX%と並んで走りたい。私の景色も、%YOURSEX%に分けたい……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b9f0cb785e9a65c58c2ebed0fffdc312",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        12
      ],
      "originalHash": "fb1c739f661f7529927ce13e5e4e51cae6e42cf1f7c102760477787e2d51d5a9",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "鈴鹿はすぐ返信してきた。期待を示す%UMA%のスタンプまで付いている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "751d52b8b6d5fc6f378da10277a405f5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        23
      ],
      "originalHash": "0a74dececa1380f287af3b29cf8d471584a459b7e43090631c521f1ea3870391",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "こうして、鈴鹿に引かれて歩き出した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8e7847d33828a8f3c758e64656f65a24",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        24
      ],
      "originalHash": "2f33739ac629557b99a6cc5676d70c1c8ddbd3ae378d9e78ed1a917fe9135fa8",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "%YOU%と鈴鹿は手を繋ぎ、学園近くの土手をゆっくり歩き、%UMA%やレースの話を気ままにした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cf62d8506ae3da440c7b1bb2f0853f11",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        35,
        "lines",
        7
      ],
      "originalHash": "11a7980c5ff2509139d230fcefb7086e77d44cfaf9e36285446decb5d4de5f9f",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "逃げ道を塞いだだけでなく、前の道まで自分で塞いでしまったのだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7e3f9711b61ca4ddb5e42e98c10fb93a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        35,
        "lines",
        33
      ],
      "originalHash": "a8fab7f21c70f576d2ef11a8c9123f4e335211d15ad5116c5e3148a7541a5979",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "鈴鹿は一瞬呆け、目元を赤くし、それから頭から飛び込んできた。勢いが強く、%YOU%は倒れそうになった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b489dd8acc52005d9d69833ff9d019b7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        35,
        "lines",
        45
      ],
      "originalHash": "69f48cb9bd5287532064a5510341a52ed515e535d2b7084eda64bcdcc5fc39fe",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "言い終わるか終わらないかのうちに、鈴鹿は%YOU%の両肩を掴み、爪先立ちで顔を近づけた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2e6522d98b09af4696428c3820f7fb94",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        35,
        "lines",
        47
      ],
      "originalHash": "815c4b78b24ad084694f5dd03c989b3800e1219f9f8688a8b59afaf05e155d93",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "これ以上なく赤い頬を見ているうち、反応する間もなく、唇にひんやりとした柔らかさが触れた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5b9022d553528779363bdc710a938ecd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "74",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "74",
        "lines",
        35,
        "lines",
        48
      ],
      "originalHash": "136349eb327ce4476116e179aad680e99a3b0ebffcf36d5102b9d73e3abcaa80",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "続いて小さな舌が唇を分け、そっと入り込んできた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "680edafbe9a9a1ec5eb001bb0e4fdcce",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        12
      ],
      "originalHash": "4cd357eee486bb73f7b3b496f2092111e92594ef15ff50c9b92abb0c077c7451",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "まとめを話そうとしたが、鈴鹿はもう上の空で、トレーナー室のほうを見ていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d754758ec0e440c9135803750e69033b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        30
      ],
      "originalHash": "c4bf297ea7ed538705b3649876cdb82e57350873f936545bd5d7fc0c470a5cc8",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "あとから気づいた。こう聞けば、ケーキに何か入っていたと鈴鹿に悟られる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "71169d7a89baf6ae39a492a70e684d93",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        42
      ],
      "originalHash": "ee5b04092676af0c76c425bcc2559e08530f31961b48ad45755cda204d45dd73",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "%SEX%は素早く体を離し、一歩退いて、これまで以上に驚いた%YOU%の顔を微笑んで見た。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "450636993e35768ef458a17b636d21ee",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        43
      ],
      "originalHash": "0a69815fd2fa2d9093cbd3dc7b14894f86c0c881b5c7219af50b5b1bedeceda9",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "鈴鹿が口へ渡したものに、%YOU%は見覚えがあった。というより、自分でケーキへ仕込んだものだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c3b09f69819ae47574fc3c68a38c05ba",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        46
      ],
      "originalHash": "caa42c8018dc45c7a4aaa2af6b95999a61feb18b762075231e0b22a883ff3f5f",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "それからやっと余裕ができ、傍らで華やかに笑っている鈴鹿を、困ったように見た。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1de45cde8f8c2c40fc095ea37d6fbb66",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        48,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "ee67202dc01cf69f8d5b431ec1a9732ee5959ba4708f4a8d51f757e54a55059b",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "「次にすることは、%CALLNAME%がこっそり何度も練習されたはずですよ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dc730827a9baa05164836e34a1f452da",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        49
      ],
      "originalHash": "0f12535d5d209d679f8b4b8a01e111f446e8f4e1579b32d142a4e1df1be54b70",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "それから鈴鹿は姿勢を正し、表情も真剣になった。だがその瞳には、十割の高揚と期待が宿っていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6b6f9c743206ccc527f538d9df099a34",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        61
      ],
      "originalHash": "7d7f507141459ea5ad8ffab307d1cc8f09498a29cc4b5d097cbf26c94fdc1715",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "顔を上げると、焦った鈴鹿の視線とぶつかった。数秒見つめ合って、二人は同時に笑い出した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cca9723c8b3a0fafc95a9fb046938906",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        62
      ],
      "originalHash": "b258a916247d3e3b6f09164801df9656cbb2367fa12db89fa7dba40ea98d3b26",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "今度は無事に、ダイヤモンドの指輪を鈴鹿の左手の薬指にはめた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fc6417d4d20c62c687a3f8634f0c36bc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "89",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "89",
        "lines",
        65
      ],
      "originalHash": "c0ae7303999d3770243bec66c8ac1609c3ade8942e464e1c58f5f5a7754c0ec2",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "胸元に縮こまる鈴鹿を見、%SEX%もまた%YOU%を抱いている力を感じて、%YOU%は馬鹿みたいに笑った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "31e0f4b9275434ad1ee1017830015d10",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "99",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "99",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "31d40fb85fe73655721b47ee948f514b9dba0174526de2e386661ce705dc82e1",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "それから右を確認し、車がいないのを見て、足早に %CHARA% のもとへ走ってきた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1796e0ddb5b28cc881e16370d18c2dba",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/love-2.kojo",
      "key": "99",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "99",
        "lines",
        27,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "52f8251417314a61f371a3ce6ccb0b1744d72576d1d20a0a384484fc4e9b5a3b",
      "sourceFileHash": "726bf9dc2e342b44b94d0c6f296496c6f134fe554323872ac1a57d41394c2352",
      "originalText": "「起こしてしまってごめんなさい。私は大丈夫です。もう寝ましょう。明日は文化の補習もありますから。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
